      {
       "text": "Fixed: Version number from 1.x to 0.x (because it's only in beta stage)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Two new areas (chinatown and fun fair - amusement park) will be added into the next update! Get ready for a Ferris Wheel and exploding Clowns! Stay tuned!",
