   "displayName": "Update Patch Notes - October 19, 2022",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-10-19T14:40:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The following updates have been implemented",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It seems that the Boss \"Bludr\" airship was too much overpowered, so it was rebalanced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed: Boss HP from 999 to 300. Also two of the cannons have now reduced their damage from 7 to 5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed: New Enemies (humans) will not spawn while you fight with the Boss",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added: Each New boss have +100HP, so it will be stronger and stronger with each unlocked area.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don't forget: If you want to unlock a new area, you need to beat the Boss! The boss always appears after 150+ killed humans.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's just a small update but very important, i think ;)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy gaming! :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "@FobTi",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
